                                                "sense_id": "fabe2237-fd97-3d35-94dc-5004ae260ec0",
                                                "text": "Captain Harry Kane was the workhorse and creator, while Sterling and Rashford provided the finishing flourishes that put England in dreamland at the interval."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec0860e0-7804-42e0-b95a-869ed16a979b",
                                                "sense_id": "fabe2237-fd97-3d35-94dc-5004ae260ec0",
                                                "text": "\"Class 08s have been the workhorses of ports, distribution centres and depots across Britain's railway for more than 60 years,\" said Positive Traction Director Alistair Gregory."
